--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dataset: Amazon Review Polarity
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Distributed as fancyzhx/amazon_polarity on the Hugging Face Hub under the
Apache License 2.0. The full dataset is not redistributed by this repository.
Two small seeded, stratified, redacted subsets, 1,000 train rows and 400 test
rows, are committed as offline fixtures under the upstream licence.

    https://huggingface.co/datasets/fancyzhx/amazon_polarity

Constructed by Xiang Zhang for:

    Xiang Zhang, Junbo Zhao, Yann LeCun.
    "Character-level Convolutional Networks for Text Classification."
    Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems 28 (NIPS 2015).

Derived from the Amazon review corpus of:

    Julian McAuley, Jure Leskovec.
    "Hidden factors and hidden topics: understanding rating dimensions with
    review text."
    Proceedings of the 7th ACM Conference on Recommender Systems, 2013,
    pp. 165-172.

